        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0v9sKfQzHHuEAgu7D6GzRACFVjoiEbEK46h1GJ_UjiF-ZOAL9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "My mother is hungry, i gad to order food for her as Le Felix does not give the same nutritious food to the residents that need care and cannot express themselves as the people on the independent side that can make their own decisions and demands.",
